<li>🟢 <strong><a href="https://github.com/thedotmack/claude-mem">thedotmack/claude-mem</a></strong> + <strong><a href="https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0">mem0ai/mem0</a></strong> — Agent 持久记忆层正成为新基础设施，跨会话上下文持久化是下一个必争之地。</li>
